OL,3,GNEWSAOlympic champion 'living out a
OL,4,Adream' on Strictly
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Olympic champion who has swapped gym
OL,7,Fkit for sequins says the opportunity to
OL,8,Ftake part in this year's Strictly Come
OL,9,FDancing is like "living out a dream".
OL,11,FTabby Stoecker, the University of Bath
OL,12,Fand Team GB athlete who won skeleton
OL,13,Fgold at the Milano Cortina Winter
OL,14,FOlympics earlier this year, will take
OL,15,Fto the dancefloor on Saturday night
OL,16,Fwith her partner Mark Karmalita to
OL,17,Fperform a jive.
OL,19,FThe 25-year-old, from Highgate, London,
OL,20,Fsaid the new challenge had led to
OL,21,Ftiredness, sore feet and aching bones.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
