OL,3,GNEWSAOlympic champion 'living out a
OL,4,Adream' on Strictly
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm genuinely having the time of my
OL,7,Flife so the longer I get to stay in
OL,8,Fthis competition the better because for
OL,9,Fme it's like living out a dream. I just
OL,10,Freally hope I can make Bath proud," she
OL,11,Fsaid.
